# shadcn instructions

Use the latest version of Shadcn to install new components:

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>
```

## Design system (preset a12)

- **Preset:** This project uses shadcn/ui preset **a12** for consistent, non-flat controls (e.g. radio buttons) and theme. When (re)configuring, use `npx shadcn@latest init --preset a12`. Get the exact preset code from https://ui.shadcn.com/create if needed.
- **Theming:** Follow https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/theming (CSS variables, `@theme inline` for new colors). New components must match the preset's radius and color conventions.
- **Skills:** Use shadcn Skills (`pnpm dlx skills add shadcn/ui`) so the assistant has project context. See https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/skills.
- **Add components:** Always extend from shadcn; do not build from scratch when a shadcn component exists (Sidebar, Sheet, Radio Group, etc.). Use `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>` per https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/cli.
